{
  "case": "corpus-attack",
  "title": "Controlled adverse corpus",
  "description": "80 synthetic adverse requests across SQLi, XSS, traversal, command signatures, scanners and four T5 bypass classes (three still known limitations). Shares signature families with T1/T2/T5; not an independent holdout or a real-world accuracy estimate.",
